OL,3,GNEWSAFresh police appeal on anniversary
OL,4,Aof fatal attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the death of a
OL,7,F91-year-old woman following a suspected
OL,8,Frobbery have appealed for information
OL,9,F12 months on from the incident.
OL,11,FElizabeth Clark, known as Betty, was
OL,12,Ffound seriously injured at her home in
OL,13,FPeveril Close, in the Kiveton Park area
OL,14,Fof Rotherham on 11 September, and died
OL,15,Fin hospital nine weeks later.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,18,Fbelieve she sustained her injuries
OL,19,Fduring an attack on 10 September, when
OL,20,Fher bank card was stolen and later used
OL,21,Fto buy alcohol and scratch cards in a
OL,22,Fnearby shop.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
